{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"fb5a9d6c5bcbdf1029b3ab09adf39da6def7b12388e9c5027045c47be3ed5fbf","ja":"「オファーを請けていただいて、本当にありがとう\nございました！　今日はよろしくお願いします！！」","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"4a7baa60b005f5d3668c83c5e1d047c5ded6c2ec41017f8419ca2f0d510c2ccf","ja":"そ、そんなに期待していただけてるなんて……。\n自信はないですけど、頑張ります。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"273db9cde2039441035ed6652d1dce775df9dc8bc089bcb37d31361cf233c652","ja":"精一杯、務めさせていただきます。\nこちらこそ、よろしくお願いいたします。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1248.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"581a17393f7f9d38429a6b4093c3a2293beda0b398410e29f598d1c628b31824","ja":"（私にうまくできるかしら……。\nき、期待が大きすぎてプレッシャーが……）","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
